{{/* @dot donseba/go-webthings-docs/internal/website.DocsArticleData */}}
<article class="grid max-w-5xl gap-6">
    {{ template "hero.gohtml" . }}

<p>go-importmap fetches JavaScript and CSS package files, caches them locally, and generates import-map and stylesheet markup. Your application publishes the assets and chooses which JavaScript modules to import.</p>
<h2>The asset workflow</h2>
<ol><li>Declare packages, versions and required files.</li><li>Fetch missing files or rebuild published assets from cache.</li><li>Include the generated head before your module scripts.</li><li>Serve the prepared files from your application.</li></ol>
<pre><code>import htmx from "htmx";
window.htmx = htmx;</code></pre>
<p>An import map gives <code>htmx</code> a URL; importing the module executes it. The map alone does not initialize a library.</p>
<h2>Explore the guide</h2>
<ul><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/installation" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/installation" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Installation and first preparation</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/packages" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/packages" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Package versions, required files and aliases</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/providers" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/providers" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Choosing CDN providers</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/storage" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/storage" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Filesystem roots and the package cache</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/rendering" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/rendering" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Import maps, styles and module shims</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/serving" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/serving" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Serving files and importing modules</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/deployment" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/deployment" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Build-time preparation and deployment</a></li></ul>
<p>See <a href="{{ basePath }}/troubleshooting" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/troubleshooting" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">troubleshooting</a> for missing assets and module formats, and <a href="{{ basePath }}/api" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/api" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">the API reference</a> for configuration and output methods.</p>
</article>
